==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 40.33 seconds<sup>1,210f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Duche]]s spawn after 40.67 seconds<sup>1,220f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 42.67 seconds<sup>1,280f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage should not give you much of a problem, as the unbuffed enemies can easily be done with basic area attackers (e.g. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris/Cyborg Cat]], or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]]), and higher crown difficulties do not greatly enhance the power of the enemies.

